# Only the redacted fixtures are committed here. Any RAW or CREDENTIALED
# artifact from a real sidecar / SP-API sandbox run must never be committed:
# it would carry an x-amz-access-token value, real notary signatures, or PII.
*
# Allow the redacted, checked-in evidence set:
!.gitignore
!README.md
!sample-bundle.json
!e2e-transcript.json
# Belt-and-braces: block anything that looks raw/credentialed even if named above.
raw-*
*-raw.json
*.token
*-credentialed.*
